# Benchmark artifacts
# summary.json and environment.txt are kept for every run — they hold all the metrics.
# The rejected stress runs' console logs are 4-12 MB each and are almost entirely one
# repeated connection-error line, so only the reproducible runs' logs are tracked.
# See perf/results/README.md.
perf/results/stress-*/run.log
